    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62980" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστ-εύω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εύσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			App.
			<u>Pun.</u>
			116
		</span></i>:—
			Pass.
		 (v. infr.), aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλῃστεύθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.55
				</span></i>
			:—<i>practise robbery</i> or <i>piracy</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ γῇ καὶ ἐν τῇ θαλάσσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					36.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.,
				<i>spoil, plunder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.14
			</span></i>, D.S.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστεύεται ἡ ὁδός</span>
			<i>is infested by robbers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.1.91
			</span></i>.</div>
